    "detailed_description": "Although it is a music game, all elements of the stage fit on one screen.<br>Every movement is predictable.<br>And yet, the instantaneous decisions required are like those of an improvised performance.<br><br>When the ball overlaps the triple line at the bottom of the stage, it can be bounced by pressing the key corresponding to the lane.<br>If you fail to push the ball, it will fall and your hearts will be reduced.<br>However, the next ball will be generated immediately.<br>the music does not stop or change.<br>Before all the hearts are gone, The stage is cleared when all the blocks are broken before all the hearts are lost.<br><br>A block that only bounces the ball.<br>Blocks that temporarily accelerate the ball.<br>Blocks that accelerate the entire song.<br>A block that splits the ball and other gimmicks.<br><br>Created out of love for traditional music games, Enjoy this strange new world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 stages<br></li><li>12 original songs with vocal synthesizer<br>(No lyrics, so you don't have to choose your language)<br></li><li>3 difficulty levels<br></li><li>Automatic and manual correction of sound delay</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Although it is a music game, all elements of the stage fit on one screen.<br>Every movement is predictable.<br>And yet, the instantaneous decisions required are like those of an improvised performance.<br><br>When the ball overlaps the triple line at the bottom of the stage, it can be bounced by pressing the key corresponding to the lane.<br>If you fail to push the ball, it will fall and your hearts will be reduced.<br>However, the next ball will be generated immediately.<br>the music does not stop or change.<br>Before all the hearts are gone, The stage is cleared when all the blocks are broken before all the hearts are lost.<br><br>A block that only bounces the ball.<br>Blocks that temporarily accelerate the ball.<br>Blocks that accelerate the entire song.<br>A block that splits the ball and other gimmicks.<br><br>Created out of love for traditional music games, Enjoy this strange new world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>12 stages<br></li><li>12 original songs with vocal synthesizer<br>(No lyrics, so you don't have to choose your language)<br></li><li>3 difficulty levels<br></li><li>Automatic and manual correction of sound delay</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A hybrid of a block breaker and a music game. A strange and fun mechanic where all of the stages fit on one screen. And the antithesis of the easy-to-see music game.",
